classDiagram
    class Priority {
        <<enumeration>>
        HIGH
        MEDIUM
        LOW
        +rank() int
    }

    class Category {
        <<enumeration>>
        WALK
        FEEDING
        MEDS
        ENRICHMENT
        GROOMING
        OTHER
    }

    class Frequency {
        <<enumeration>>
        ONCE
        DAILY
        WEEKLY
    }

    class Species {
        <<enumeration>>
        DOG
        CAT
        OTHER
    }

    class Task {
        +str id
        +str title
        +int duration_minutes
        +Priority priority
        +Category category
        +time fixed_time
        +Frequency frequency
        +int weekday
        +str notes
        +date completed_on
        +validate() None
        +is_due(day) bool
        +mark_complete(day) None
        +is_complete(day) bool
        +update(**fields) None
        +sort_key() tuple
    }

    class Pet {
        +str id
        +str name
        +Species species
        +list~Task~ tasks
        +add_task(task) None
        +remove_task(task_id) None
        +get_task(task_id) Task
        +tasks_due(day) list~Task~
    }

    class Preferences {
        +time earliest_start
        +dict preferred_times
    }

    class Owner {
        +str name
        +time available_start
        +time available_end
        +Preferences preferences
        +list~Pet~ pets
        +add_pet(pet) None
        +remove_pet(pet_id) None
        +get_all_tasks() list~tuple~
        +all_tasks_due(day) list~tuple~
        +available_minutes() int
        +set_availability(start, end) None
    }

    class Scheduler {
        +build_plan(owner, day) Plan
        -_place_fixed(entries, plan, day) None
        -_find_gaps(owner, plan, day) list
        -_fill_gaps(entries, gaps, plan) None
        -_reason_for(task, placed_fixed) str
    }

    class Plan {
        +date day
        +list~ScheduledEntry~ scheduled
        +list~UnscheduledEntry~ unscheduled
        +list~Conflict~ conflicts
        +is_stale_for(owner) bool
    }

    class ScheduledEntry {
        +Task task
        +Pet pet
        +time start
        +time end
        +str reason
    }

    class UnscheduledEntry {
        +Task task
        +Pet pet
        +str reason
    }

    class Conflict {
        +ScheduledEntry first
        +ScheduledEntry second
        +str message
    }

    note for Pet "id is a uuid4 string, same as Task.id.\nTwo pets may share a name and species,\nso remove and lookup use id, not name or object equality.\nTask, Pet and Owner use eq=False (identity equality)."
    note for Scheduler "Fixed-time tasks are placed first, whatever their priority.\nFlexible tasks are placed greedily by sort_key into the first gap that fits."

    Owner "1" *-- "0..*" Pet : has
    Owner "1" *-- "1" Preferences
    Pet "1" *-- "0..*" Task : has
    Task --> Priority
    Task --> Category
    Task --> Frequency
    Pet --> Species
    Scheduler ..> Owner : reads via all_tasks_due
    Scheduler ..> Plan : creates
    Plan "1" *-- "0..*" ScheduledEntry
    Plan "1" *-- "0..*" UnscheduledEntry
    Plan "1" *-- "0..*" Conflict
    Conflict --> ScheduledEntry : first
    Conflict --> ScheduledEntry : second
    ScheduledEntry --> Task
    ScheduledEntry --> Pet
    UnscheduledEntry --> Task
    UnscheduledEntry --> Pet
